<title>PERU: Peru's money base contracts 7.1 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base contracts 7.1 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base contracted 7.1 percent during January to stand at 3.711 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.996 billion soles, up from 3.658 billion soles at the start of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
